Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 19:40:34 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] tests: kv_stream_overlap_parity checks the slot map's
 invariants instead of its bytes, two layers share one staging pool with
 prefetch ahead, described as a kernel concurrency check (opt-in
 STRATA_PIPE_OVERLAP_KVS=1)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/kernels/kv_stream_overlap_parity.cpp | 122 ++++++++++++++++-------
 1 file changed, 85 insertions(+), 37 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/kernels/kv_stream_overlap_parity.cpp b/src/kernels/kv_stream_overlap_parity.cpp
